# BuildKit reads this file, beside the Dockerfile of the same name, in place of the context's own .dockerignore. The
# context is addons/, every add-on and the kit they share; this build reads the kit's module and the CMA add-on's, and
# nothing else enters the context.
*
!kit
!cma
# livecheck is a module of its own that imports the root module, so the image must not need it; kind holds the example's
# kind values.
cma/livecheck
cma/kind
**/*.md
**/*.test
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/kubeconfig*
# A local run's SQLite store (SQLITE_PATH defaults to a file in the working directory) and its journal files.
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
